# F11-15 lab input: data-flow diagram of the course robot (as built in RB courses).
# Zones are trust zones: everything in one zone trusts everything else in it.
title Course robot, version 1 of the threat model
external operator Operator
process  laptop   Teleop app
process  robot    Navigation stack
process  robot    Motor bridge
store    robot    Map and parameters
store    robot    Robot log [log]
process  robot    Service console
process  mcu      Motor controller firmware
external world    Lidar and camera
external world    Wheels and motors
external world    Person at the robot
process  vendor   Update server
flow Operator -> Teleop app : joystick, goals
flow Teleop app -> Navigation stack : goals, velocity commands
flow Navigation stack -> Teleop app : video, status
flow Lidar and camera -> Navigation stack : scans, images
flow Map and parameters -> Navigation stack : map, parameters
flow Navigation stack -> Robot log : events
flow Navigation stack -> Motor bridge : velocity
flow Motor bridge -> Motor controller firmware : wheel speeds
flow Motor controller firmware -> Motor bridge : encoder counts
flow Motor controller firmware -> Wheels and motors : motor drive
flow Update server -> Navigation stack : software update [mac]
flow Person at the robot -> Service console : shell commands
flow Service console -> Map and parameters : edits
